<headline>FINAL PRICING - Kansas City IDA, Mo..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it received the written award for the $30.000 million of Kansas City IDA, Mo., revenue (Ewing Marion Kauffman Foundation Project) bonds, Series 1997 B, with a top yield of 5.90 percent in 2027.</p>
